(SOFTWARE REQUIREMENTS ANALYSIS \(SRA\)) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Invoice Management Module - Iconic Hishab Accounting Software) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Prepared date: 14-Sep-2026) Tj
T*
(Version: 1.0) Tj
T*
(Analysis basis: implemented invoice module source, current UI feedback, and accounting) Tj
T*
(workflow requirements.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(1. Executive Summary) Tj
T*
(====================) Tj
T*
(The invoice module is a branch-aware accounting workflow that turns customer billing) Tj
T*
(activity into controlled accounting vouchers. The main business challenge is preserving) Tj
T*
(audit history while allowing practical edits to invoice items and payments. Invoice item) Tj
T*
(edits should be recalculation events; payment/refund events should remain independent) Tj
T*
(history entries linked to vouchers.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(2. Stakeholder Needs) Tj
T*
(====================) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Stakeholder | Need | Module Response) Tj
T*
(-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------) Tj
T*
(Business owner | Accurate customer invoice and due tracking | List, detail, due status,) Tj
T*
(payment history, and summary report.) Tj
T*
(Accounts user | Collect partial payments later without losing previous records | Date-wise) Tj
T*
(payment history and receipt vouchers.) Tj
T*
(Manager/Auditor | Trace every financial change | Voucher links and invoice audit logs.) Tj
T*
(Admin | Control role access | Invoice module permissions: create/read/update/delete.) Tj
T*
(Mobile/laptop user | Usable list screen on small devices | Responsive table/card layout with) Tj
T*
(horizontal overflow protection.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(3. Workflow Analysis) Tj
T*
(====================) Tj
T*
(- Create Invoice: user selects customer from Particular Accounts, enters item details,) Tj
T*
(optional initial paid amount, then creates final invoice or saves draft.) Tj
T*
(- Draft Flow: draft can be edited and later finalized; vouchers are created only during) Tj
T*
(finalization.) Tj
T*
(- Final Invoice Edit: item rate/price and quantity can be edited; existing payment history) Tj
T*
(stays intact; totals and status are recalculated.) Tj
T*
(- Payment Flow: due collection, refund, and payment edit are operational actions on Edit) Tj
T*
(Invoice page; View Invoice shows history and related vouchers.) Tj
T*
(- Report Flow: Invoice Summary Report aggregates invoice totals, paid, refund, due, and) Tj
T*
(status rows by filters.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(4. Requirement Prioritization) Tj
T*
(=============================) Tj
T*
ET
endstream
