() Tj
T*
(Requirement Area | Priority | Reason) Tj
T*
(-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------) Tj
T*
(Accurate voucher posting | Must Have | Core accounting impact; wrong vouchers affect) Tj
T*
(ledgers.) Tj
T*
(Payment/refund history | Must Have | Partial payment business flow requires date-wise) Tj
T*
(traceability.) Tj
T*
(Draft/finalize separation | Must Have | Prevents premature accounting entries.) Tj
T*
(Responsive invoice list | Should Have | Operational usability across devices.) Tj
T*
(Print/PDF | Should Have | Required for customer-facing invoice/report output.) Tj
T*
(Customer create shortcut | Could Have | Improves user efficiency but does not change) Tj
T*
(accounting logic.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(5. Data and Calculation Analysis) Tj
T*
(================================) Tj
T*
(The module uses Invoice as the master record, InvoiceItem for line-level billing data,) Tj
T*
(InvoicePayment for payment/refund history, InvoiceVoucher for accounting posting links, and) Tj
T*
(InvoiceAuditLog for traceability. Paid amount should be calculated from non-refund payments) Tj
T*
(minus refunds or stored paidAmount synchronized after each event. Due amount equals) Tj
T*
(grandTotal minus paidAmount and should not rely on UI-only values.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Scenario | Expected Calculation) Tj
T*
(-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------) Tj
T*
(Grand total 10,000; payments 3,000 + 2,000 | Paid 5,000; Due 5,000; Status PARTIALLY_PAID.) Tj
T*
(Then item edit makes grand total 5,000 | Paid 5,000; Due 0; Status PAID; payment history) Tj
T*
(remains.) Tj
T*
(Refund 1,000 after paid 5,000 | Paid/net collected 4,000; refund total 1,000; Due) Tj
T*
(recalculated according to grand total.) Tj
T*
(Draft saved with initial paid amount | No voucher until finalization; finalization posts) Tj
T*
(initial paid/due vouchers.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(6. Risk Analysis) Tj
T*
(================) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Risk | Impact | Mitigation) Tj
T*
(-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------) Tj
T*
(Invoice total edited below collected amount | Incorrect paid/due state or overpayment |) Tj
T*
(Block the update or require refund/adjustment before allowing it.) Tj
T*
(Deleting finalized invoice | Audit/report data loss | Restrict delete to Draft and Cancelled) Tj
T*
(statuses.) Tj
T*
(Voucher reversal not linked | Ledger mismatch | Create InvoiceVoucher records with) Tj
T*
(postingType REVERSAL and audit log entries.) Tj
T*
(Role missing Invoice permission after deployment | Menu/actions hidden for users | Seed/sync) Tj
T*
(Invoice permissions and assign role permissions.) Tj
T*
(Small-screen table clipping | User cannot access actions | Use responsive card view or) Tj
T*
(horizontal scroll with min-width table.) Tj
T*
ET
