T*
(payment form, refund form, payment history edit action.) Tj
T*
(Edit Invoice | Editable item price/quantity, collect due payment, refund form, payment) Tj
T*
(history edit/action | Duplicate read-only report-only blocks that confuse edit workflow.) Tj
T*
(Summary Report | Filters, totals, refund total, list rows, print/PDF | Direct mutation) Tj
T*
(actions.) Tj
T*
() Tj
